  "store": {
    "tagline": "Weave through highway traffic at speed",
    "category": "fun",
    "play": true,
    "platforms": [
      "macos",
      "linux"
    ],
    "actions": [
      {
        "title": "Drive",
        "description": "Up is the gas, down the brake, left and right steer; WASD too.",
        "keys": "up, down, left, right"
      },
      {
        "title": "Light the nitro",
        "description": "Near misses fill the bar; Space or Shift burns it for speed and double points.",
        "keys": "space"
      },
      {
        "title": "Change the view",
        "description": "Low behind the car, chase, the classic high angle, bumper, high, tower or long lens.",
        "keys": "c"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pause or carry on",
        "keys": "p"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sound on or off",
        "keys": "m"
      },
      {
        "title": "In the garage",
        "description": "Up and down pick a line, left and right change it, Enter buys, Space drives.",
        "keys": "enter"
      }
    ],
    "features": [
      "Handling built for feel: the car goes where your thumb says and stops where you let go, leaning and diving on its springs; a better car or a handling upgrade turns quicker and switches direction sooner",
      "Traffic with drivers: they keep their distance, brake, signal and change lanes when it's safe, placed so a lane is always open",
      "Pass close above 100 km/h for a near miss, graded by the gap you left; near misses within four seconds build a combo, and threading a gap between two cars pays a bonus",
      "Nitro: near misses fill it, Space burns it for speed past your top and double points",
      "Four modes: Endless, Two-Way (the oncoming side pays three times), Time Attack against the clock, and Speed Trap above a rising speed",
      "Driver levels from 1 to 40 that open modes, places and paint collections, and three missions at a time that grow with you",
      "Seventeen cars in five classes, City to Super, each quicker and sharper than the last with its own engine note; engine, handling, brake and nitro upgrades, and the garage shows what each one adds before you pay",
      "Five places under photographed skies, from a cloudy countryside to a night run with headlights; close pal mid-run and it waits where you left it",
      "A leaderboard for each mode; signed in, your cash, cars, level and records follow you to your other machines and play.cagdas.io"
    ],
    "screenshots": [
      {
        "file": "1-run.png",
        "caption": "196 km/h through countryside traffic in the Stinger '96, the drivers signalling and keeping their gaps"
      },
      {
        "file": "2-garage.png",
        "caption": "The garage: choose, paint and upgrade your car, pick the mode and place; your level, the next unlock and three missions beside it"
      },
      {
        "file": "3-night.png",
        "caption": "A night run: headlights on the road, tail lamps ahead, brake lights when a driver slows"
      },
      {
        "file": "4-twoway.png",
        "caption": "Two-Way at high noon: the oncoming side pays three times, and touching it ends the run"
      },
      {
        "file": "5-results.png",
        "caption": "The end of a run: the pay counted up line by line, the XP toward your next level, and how far each mission got"
      }
    ]
  },
